      "id": 2001,
      "options": {
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "**Scope note:** `xo-server-openmetrics` currently exposes a single backup-related metric, `xo_backup_job_total{type}` — the number of *configured* backup jobs per type (full/delta/mirror/metadata/...). **It is not a run-status metric**: there is no success/failure counter, duration, or last-run timestamp available via OpenMetrics today. For actual backup run outcomes, use XO's Backup reports (email alerts), the Tasks view, or the REST API.\n\nThis dashboard therefore combines the real `xo_backup_job_total` panel with the surrounding XO management-plane context (fleet size, XO process health) that backup jobs depend on.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.2.2+security-01",
      "title": "About this dashboard",
      "type": "text"
    },
